ate with Google or weaken privacy\n* Strip binaries from the source tree, and use those provided by the system or build them from source\n* Add, modify, or disable features that inhibit control and transparency (these changes are minor and do not have significant impacts on the general user experience)\n\nungoogled-chromium should not be considered a fork of Chromium. \nThe main reason for this is that a fork is associated with more significant deviations from the Chromium, such as branding, configuration formats, file locations, and other interface changes. \nungoogled-chromium will not modify the Chromium browser outside of the project's goals. Since these goals and requirements are not precise, unclear situations are discussed and decided on a case-by-case basis.","moniker":"ungoogled-chromium","name":"Chromium","packageUrl":"https://github.com/Eloston/ungoogled-chromium#downloads","publisher":"The Chromium Authors","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/Eloston/ungoogled-chromium","tags":["browser","chromium","ungoogled"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://github.com/Eloston/ungoogled-chromium","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.9.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/96.0.4664.110/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.yaml","sha256":"ddb66ac7b4ddfb6e81ae35c6a8e9f31b1db25af6ebeed70de3700852ad3c7f84"},{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/96.0.4664.110/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.installer.yaml","sha256":"3a507d079c2e62dd4eee6716af799d2ecdd5fa702b7e39aebef03db4a2462bc6"},{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/96.0.4664.110/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"6ee3a6b3832ec68e83b4c6842899f56d6f62b1213a61ef5a651319d3b77f9f0e"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"96.0.4664.110"}